      "writtenOn": "2024-12-19T22:08:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why `topdown\u003dFalse`? Also, the documentation for `os.walk` says: `Whether or not the lists are sorted depends on the file system`, so I think we need to intoduce some sorting to make this deterministic. Also we need `followlinks\u003dFalse`.",
      "revId": "4b046959b69004f24220965b910a09c4fdf38725",
